# "Three or more counters on it" are counters of any kind. Arwen, Mortal Queen's ability (turn 1) puts a +1/+1 counter and a lifelink
# counter on the Warden: two counters, so it has lifelink (from the counter) but no flying or vigilance. On turn 3 its own ability
# adds a third, a +1/+1 counter, and it gains flying and vigilance as well. (Scenario ...-grows-and-scries-and-flies-with-three-counters
# is the same threshold with +1/+1 counters alone.)

